{title: I Have Decided to Follow Jesus}
{artist: Traditional (attributed to Sadhu Sundar Singh)}
{genre: Gospel, Children}
{style: Traditional}
{flow: Response}
{key: G}
{tempo: 84}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
I have de[G]cided to follow Je[C]sus
I have de[G]cided to follow Je[D]sus
I have de[G]cided to follow Je[C]sus
No turning [G]back, no turning [D]back[G]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Though none go [G]with me, I still will fol[C]low
Though none go [G]with me, I still will fol[D]low
Though none go [G]with me, I still will fol[C]low
No turning [G]back, no turning [D]back[G]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
The world be[G]hind me, the cross be[C]fore me
The world be[G]hind me, the cross be[D]fore me
The world be[G]hind me, the cross be[C]fore me
No turning [G]back, no turning [D]back[G]
{end_of_verse}
